  limitations: "Forty-four registered APIs are covered: thirty-five direct original bodies and nine compiler-inlined calls, under default or serde features on x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu. The eleven two/four-word state serialization guarantees depend on the explicit primitive layout model and its documented compiler/model boundary. The five 32-bit-engine try_next_u64 compositions, buffer filling, seed construction, jump/long_jump, Seed512 formatting and external iterator operations, manual Debug, serde and inherited/default/external blanket methods remain outside these registered Aeneas claims. Separate Kani seed/state/composition evidence is supplementary and not an Aeneas claim. All-zero states are included in the formulas; ordinary seed reachability, period, distribution, independence and cryptographic security are not established. Other targets and untested dependency feature combinations are not covered." -> "The 69 mapped contracts comprise 35 direct bodies and 34 compiler-inlined original calls, including exactly 25 external blanket specializations. The five 32-bit-engine try_next_u64 compositions and corresponding external Rng::next_u64 specializations remain outside these Aeneas claims. Seed construction, buffer filling, jump/long_jump, Debug/formatting, serde implementations and other inherited/default/blanket methods are not completed. Seed512 iterator initialization does not prove iterator operation bodies. Serializer layout dictionaries cover only the frozen U32/U64 use closure; arbitrary type layout is not established. Separate Kani seed/state/composition evidence has its own documented compiler and domain boundaries. No seed reachability, period, distribution, independence or cryptographic property follows from these transition formulas. Other targets and feature/dependency combinations are not covered."
